- 00: 1 channel transmit.
- 01: 2 channel transmit.
- 10: 6 channel transmit.
- 11: 8 channel transmit. Others: Reserved. tx_multislot_en = 1 Channel count select for transmit in time-division multiplexing mode.
- 00: 2 channel transmit.
- 01: 4 channel transmit.
- 10: 8 channel transmit.
- 11: 16 channel transmit. Note 1: For multi-channel transmit, only data line 0 (sd0) is used. Note 2: TX does not support time-division multiplexing mode.";
            sw = rw; hw = r;
            reset = 0x0;
        } tx_ch_num[5:4];
        field {
